sequenceDiagram
    title Tra cứu hóa đơn
    actor Customer
    actor Employee
    participant CustomerApp
    participant AdminPortal
    participant API
    participant InvoiceService
    participant PostgreSQL

    Customer->>CustomerApp: Xem hóa đơn của đơn hàng
    CustomerApp->>API: GET /orders/:orderId/invoice
    API->>InvoiceService: Verify customer owns order
    InvoiceService->>PostgreSQL: Query invoice by order and customer
    PostgreSQL-->>InvoiceService: Invoice summary or none
    InvoiceService-->>API: Invoice summary
    API-->>CustomerApp: 200 invoice or 404
    Employee->>AdminPortal: Xem hóa đơn quản trị
    AdminPortal->>API: GET /admin/orders/:orderId/invoice
    API->>InvoiceService: Verify active employee JWT
    InvoiceService->>PostgreSQL: Query invoice by order
    PostgreSQL-->>InvoiceService: Invoice summary or none
    InvoiceService-->>API: Invoice summary
    API-->>AdminPortal: 200 invoice or 404
